@host = http://localhost:5126

### OpenAPI document (Swagger UI: {{host}}/swagger)
GET {{host}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Create a category
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryName":"Stationery"}

### List categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Create a product (replace categoryId with the returned UUID)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","productName":"Notebook","price":"75.00","cost":"50.00"}

### List products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Create a transaction (replace SKU and categoryID with returned values)
POST {{host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"IN","date":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z","reason":"Initial stock","items":[{"sku":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","categoryId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}]}

### List transactions
GET {{host}}/api/transactions
